{"availability":"available","full":"s4lmon778/PixelGate","name":"PixelGate","description":"Direct browser-to-browser file transfers with resumable checkpoints, independent SHA-256 verification, and local storage.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-06T21:20:54Z","updated":"2026-10-10T00:19:09Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://s4lmon778.github.io/PixelGate/","topics":["file-transfer","github-pages","indexeddb","privacy","react","resumable-transfers","sha256","typescript","vite","web-workers","webrtc"],"demo":"https://s4lmon778.github.io/PixelGate/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:26.517Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:26.517Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:26.517Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:04:26.517Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Direct browser-to-browser transfers with resumable checkpoints and independent SHA-256 verification.","PixelGate moves files between computers, phones, and tablets using their browsers. File bytes travel over a direct encrypted WebRTC data channel. The receiver closes and rereads each stored file before comparing its SHA-256 with the source. Filenames, manifests, hashes, file bytes, and transfer history remain on the participating devices.","The app is a static TypeScript / React / Vite build hosted on GitHub Pages. PeerJS exchanges connection metadata for six-digit pairing; it carries no file payloads. No native app, account, cloud media storage, or TURN relay is required."],"features":["Pairing and approval: six-digit entry, QR links, receiver consent, expiry, and revocation. Copy/paste pairing is available when signaling is unavailable.","Files and folders: multiple selection, recursive drops where supported, Unicode filenames, preserved relative paths, and destination-path validation.","Integrity and recovery: incremental worker hashing, independent stored-file readback, durable checkpoints, and resume after source reselection and rehashing.","Parallel transfers: learn path delivery rates and sequence chunks across up to five independent peer connections, recover gaps on another lane, restore order, and overlap up to four checkpoints, with legacy fallback.","Saving: Android Chrome 132+ Photos device-folder saving for the whole collection, direct folder writes with destination readback, native save/share where supported, whole-collection verified downloads, Google Photos…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/s4lmon778/PixelGate/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d27f62e8b7382bf23a05b0cd2bc559ccf814d24e8cb0aca183281a9e4bcaeb2c","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:26.592Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:26.592Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Direct browser-to-browser transfers with resumable checkpoints and independent SHA-256 verification.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/s4lmon778/PixelGate/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"No native app, account, cloud media storage, or TURN relay is required.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/s4lmon778/PixelGate/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"d27f62e8b7382bf23a05b0cd2bc559ccf814d24e8cb0aca183281a9e4bcaeb2c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/s4lmon778/PixelGate/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:26.593Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T00:19:09Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/s4lmon778/PixelGate/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:26.594Z","hash":"d27f62e8b7382bf23a05b0cd2bc559ccf814d24e8cb0aca183281a9e4bcaeb2c","originalBytes":21007,"storedBytes":21007,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["browser","docs","files","tests","file","transfer","pairing","storage","lib","pixelgate","run","source","app","bridge","bytes","deployment","history","local","receiver","recovery","verified","assets","checkpoint","device"